          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>About • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbfbfb;--card:#fff;--muted:#6b6b6b;--accent:#6b8e7f;--accent-2:#a6cbb7;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)}\\n    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);color:#222}\\n    nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:22px 36px}\\n    nav a{color:#333;text-decoration:none;margin-left:20px;font-weight:600}\\n    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:32px;align-items:center;padding:40px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(246,248,247,0.6),transparent);border-radius:12px}\\n    .hero h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#173826}\\n    .hero p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}\\n    .hero .actions{margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .muted-link{margin-left:12px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}\\n    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(17,17,17,0.04)}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:26px}\\n    .stat{padding:18px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),#fff);text-align:center}\\n    .stat h3{margin:0;color:#234936}\\n    .benefits{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:28px}\\n    .benefit{flex:1;padding:18px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px}\\n    .process{margin-top:28px}\\n    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .avatar{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;padding:26px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:24px}\\n    input[type='email']{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:20px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.benefits{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <nav>\\n    <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <div>\\n      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n      <a href='about.html'>About the Practice</a>\\n      <a href='services.html'>Work With Me</a>\\n      <a href='programs.html'>Programs</a>\\n      <a href='testimonials.html'>Stories</a>\\n      <a href='book.html' class='btn' style='margin-left:18px;padding:8px 12px'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <main class='container'>\\n    <section class='hero panel'>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>A softer way to steady your habits and reclaim everyday calm</h1>\\n        <p>I help busy people build reliable daily routines through small, sustainable shifts in environment, attention, and scheduling. My approach centers on clarity, compassion, and practical frameworks you can use right away.</p>\\n        <div class='actions'>\\n          <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>Work with me</a>\\n          <a class='muted-link' href='#philosophy'>Read my philosophy</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='grid' aria-hidden='false'>\\n          <div class='stat panel'><h3>36+</h3><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Lives reshaped</p></div>\\n          <div class='stat panel'><h3>92%</h3><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Report clearer routines</p></div>\\n          <div class='stat panel'><h3>1:1 + Workshops</h3><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Flexible formats</p></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-items:center'>\\n        <img src='assets/img/hero.svg' alt='abstract gallery art' style='width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(17,17,17,0.06)'>\\n        <div class='panel' style='width:100%;text-align:left'>\\n          <img src='assets/img/avatar.svg' alt='{{COACH_NAME}}' style='width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;float:left;margin-right:12px'>\\n          <div style='overflow:hidden'>\\n            <strong>{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</strong>\\n            <div style='color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:6px'>Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — remote and in-studio availability</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section id='philosophy' class='panel' style='margin-top:24px'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#1f4d3e'>Coaching philosophy</h2>\\n      <p style='color:var(--muted)'>I teach micro-habit architecture: small context edits + simple rituals that reduce friction and invite momentum. No strict rules, just gentle experiments you can keep or iterate. The aim is durable practice, not perfection.</p>\\n\\n      <div class='benefits' aria-hidden='false'>\\n        <div class='benefit'>\\n          <strong>Clarity</strong>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Define what matters and make it visible each day.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='benefit'>\\n          <strong>Structure</strong>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Simple frameworks to organize time, energy, and decision-making.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='benefit'>\\n          <strong>Support</strong>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Friendly accountability and progress markers that feel achievable.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='process panel' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#1f4d3e'>The Gentle Framework — 4 steps</h2>\\n      <div class='steps'>\\n        <div class='step'><strong>1.</strong><div style='color:var(--muted);margin-left:8px'>Clarity call to name the change.</div></div>\\n        <div class='step'><strong>2.</strong><div style='color:var(--muted);margin-left:8px'>Design micro-habits aligned with your rhythms.</div></div>\\n        <div class='step'><strong>3.</strong><div style='color:var(--muted);margin-left:8px'>Practice with short check-ins and tailored adjustments.</div></div>\\n        <div class='step'><strong>4.</strong><div style='color:var(--muted);margin-left:8px'>Embed wins into a sustainable weekly pattern.</div></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='panel' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#1f4d3e'>Client stories</h2>\\n      <blockquote style='margin:0;padding:12px;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);color:var(--muted)'>\\\"Working with {{COACH_NAME}} changed how I plan my mornings — now I leave the house calm and on time.\\\" — A client in {{CITY}}</blockquote>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='panel' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#1f4d3e'>Questions people ask</h2>\\n      <details style='margin-bottom:8px'><summary style='cursor:pointer;font-weight:700'>How do sessions actually work?</summary><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Most clients start with a 60-minute intake then move to 45-minute weekly sessions. We set 1–3 focused experiments between meetings.</p></details>\\n      <details style='margin-bottom:8px'><summary style='cursor:pointer;font-weight:700'>Is this for people with hectic schedules?</summary><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Yes — the work prioritizes tiny changes that fit existing routines and reduce decision fatigue.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary style='cursor:pointer;font-weight:700'>What results can I expect?</summary><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Clearer routines, fewer missed intentions, and a sense of momentum. We avoid medical or diagnostic promises.</p></details>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='panel' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#1f4d3e'>Free guide — small rituals that stick</h2>\\n      <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Join the list and get a practical 5-page guide you can use this week to shape one daily habit.</p>\\n      <form style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px' action='#' method='post'>\\n        <input type='email' placeholder='Your email' required>\\n        <button class='btn' type='submit'>Get the guide</button>\\n      </form>\\n      <p style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px'>No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='panel' style='margin-top:18px;text-align:center'>\\n      <h3 style='margin:0 0 12px'>Ready to try a gentle shift?</h3>\\n      <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>Book my clarity call</a>\\n      <div style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px'>Or reach out at <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--accent)'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <small>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a> • <a href='privacy.html'>Privacy</a></small>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>Services • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--ink:#12342a;--soft:#f4f7f5;--accent:#7aa893}\\n    body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;margin:0;background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:22px 36px}\\n    header a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}\\n    .hero{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;padding:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,transparent);border-radius:14px}\\n    .hero .copy h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px}\\n    .hero .copy p{color:#576a60}\\n    .card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .service{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(12,12,12,0.05)}\\n    .price{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px}\\n    .small{color:#6b7a72;font-size:14px}\\n    .process{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .process .step{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;flex:1}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:20px}\\n    input[type='email']{flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e8eee8}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;text-align:center;color:#6b7a72}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.card-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{flex-direction:column}.process{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n      <a href='about.html'>Approach</a>\\n      <a href='services.html'>Services</a>\\n      <a href='pricing.html'>Pricing</a>\\n      <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class='wrap'>\\n    <section class='hero'>\\n      <div class='copy'>\\n        <h1>Focused sessions. Lasting change.</h1>\\n        <p>Short, practical coaching tracks that center habit-building, context shaping, and real-life routines. Pick what fits your tempo — from quick problem-solving to immersive VIP attention.</p>\\n        <div style='margin-top:14px'>\\n          <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700'>Get started</a>\\n          <a href='programs.html' style='margin-left:12px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600'>See programs</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style='width:340px'>\\n        <img src='assets/img/avatar.svg' alt='avatar art' style='width:100%;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)'>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:20px'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--ink)'>Offerings — pick the right rhythm</h2>\\n      <p class='small'>Each option includes tailored check-ins, a clear framework, and suggested micro-habits to test between meetings.</p>\\n\\n      <div class='card-grid' aria-hidden='false'>\\n        <div class='service'>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Spark Session</h3>\\n          <div class='price'>$150</div>\\n          <p class='small'>60-minute intensive to solve one pressing routine or habit. Ideal for immediate clarity.</p>\\n          <ul style='color:#576a60'>\\n            <li>Actionable 3-step plan</li>\\n            <li>One week follow-up msg</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='service'>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Rhythm Coaching (4 weeks)</h3>\\n          <div class='price'>$650</div>\\n          <p class='small'>Weekly 45-minute sessions, tailored habit design, and gentle accountability. Great for building momentum.</p>\\n          <ul style='color:#576a60'>\\n            <li>Personalized rituals</li>\\n            <li>Email support between sessions</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='service'>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>VIP Reset Day</h3>\\n          <div class='price'>$1,250</div>\\n          <p class='small'>A focused day with deep design work: routines, environment setup, and a 30-day maintenance plan. Includes same-week follow-up.</p>\\n          <ul style='color:#576a60'>\\n            <li>All materials + planning workbook</li>\\n            <li>Two follow-ups in first month</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:20px' class='panel'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--ink)'>How a typical service flows</h2>\\n      <div class='process'>\\n        <div class='step'>\\n          <strong>Discovery</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b7a72;margin-top:8px'>Clarify the outcome you care about.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='step'>\\n          <strong>Design</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b7a72;margin-top:8px'>Create tiny experiments that fit your life.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='step'>\\n          <strong>Practice</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b7a72;margin-top:8px'>Try, tweak, and track progress with short check-ins.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px' class='panel'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--ink)'>What clients notice</h2>\\n      <ul style='color:#576a60'>\\n        <li>Less decision fatigue in mornings and evenings</li>\\n        <li>More reliable completion of priority tasks</li>\\n        <li>Small wins feel repeatable and calm</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px' class='panel'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--ink)'>Service FAQ</h2>\\n      <details style='margin-bottom:8px'><summary style='font-weight:700'>Do you offer sliding scale?</summary><p style='color:#6b7a72'>Some options for financial flexibility exist — email <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a> to discuss.</p></details>\\n      <details style='margin-bottom:8px'><summary style='font-weight:700'>Can I do a standalone VIP day?</summary><p style='color:#6b7a72'>Yes — VIP Reset Days are available as a one-off for clients seeking concentrated support.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary style='font-weight:700'>Are sessions virtual?</summary><p style='color:#6b7a72'>Mostly virtual, with select in-person offerings in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p></details>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px' class='panel'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--ink)'>Free checklist</h2>\\n      <p style='color:#6b7a72'>Download a quick checklist: 9 small edits to your morning routine.</p>\\n      <form style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px' action='#' method='post'>\\n        <input type='email' placeholder='Email address' required>\\n        <button class='btn' type='submit' style='background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px'>Send me the checklist</button>\\n      </form>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px;text-align:center'>\\n      <h3>Interested in a tailored plan?</h3>\\n      <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700'>Schedule a call</a>\\n      <p class='small' style='margin-top:8px'>Questions? <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <small>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{COACH_NAME}} • {{CREDENTIALS}}</small>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"programs.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>Programs • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f8faf8;--ink:#15372b;--muted:#6b756f;--accent:#8fb298}\\n    body{font-family:Georgia,serif;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 36px}\\n    header a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:22px;align-items:center;padding:26px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:30px}\\n    .catalog{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .offer{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(10,10,10,0.04)}\\n    .tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}\\n    .price{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);margin-top:8px}\\n    .note{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}\\n    input[type='email']{flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6ece6}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.catalog{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n      <a href='programs.html'>Paths</a>\\n      <a href='services.html'>Services</a>\\n      <a href='testimonials.html'>Stories</a>\\n      <a href='pricing.html'>Pricing</a>\\n      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class='wrap'>\\n    <section class='hero'>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Choose a path that fits your life</h1>\\n        <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Three curated programs that blend coaching time, habit design, and follow-through. Each path is framed by a clear outcome and weekly cadence.</p>\\n        <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700'>Start with a clarity call</a>\\n          <a href='services.html' style='margin-left:12px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700'>Compare services</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <img src='assets/img/pattern.svg' alt='decorative pattern' style='width:100%;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)'>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='catalog' aria-hidden='false'>\\n      <div class='offer'>\\n        <span class='tag'>Momentum Month</span>\\n        <h3 style='margin:8px 0'>4-week coaching</h3>\\n        <p class='note'>For folks who want a focused push to set routines and practice them. Includes a kickoff session and three coaching calls.</p>\\n        <div class='price'>$650</div>\\n        <ul style='color:var(--muted)'>\\n          <li>60-min onboarding session</li>\\n          <li>3 x 45-min coaching calls</li>\\n          <li>Action plan + accountability</li>\\n        </ul>\\n        <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <a href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' class='btn' style='background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none'>Apply</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='offer'>\\n        <span class='tag'>VIP Reset Day</span>\\n        <h3 style='margin:8px 0'>Deep design + strategy</h3>\\n        <p class='note'>A single immersive day to redesign your routines, set up your environment, and leave with a 30-day plan. Ideal for high-leverage change.</p>\\n        <div class='price'>$1,250</div>\\n        <ul style='color:var(--muted)'>\\n          <li>Full-day intensive (remote or in-person)</li>\\n          <li>Immediate habit playbook</li>\\n          <li>Two 30-min follow-ups in month one</li>\\n        </ul>\\n        <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <a href='book.html' class='btn' style='background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none'>Reserve a date</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='offer'>\\n        <span class='tag'>Foundations 12</span>\\n        <h3 style='margin:8px 0'>12-week program</h3>\\n        <p class='note'>A steady, paced program for people who want to embed multiple habits and create a weekly architecture for sustained change.</p>\\n        <div class='price'>$2,100 or 3x $750</div>\\n        <ul style='color:var(--muted)'>\\n          <li>Weekly 45-min coaching</li>\\n          <li>Structured habit lab with worksheets</li>\\n          <li>Progress tracking and monthly summaries</li>\\n        </ul>\\n        <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <a href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' class='btn' style='background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none'>Enroll</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px' class='panel'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px'>How enrollment works</h2>\\n      <ol style='color:var(--muted)'>\\n        <li>Schedule a 30-minute clarity call to pick the right path.</li>\\n        <li>Receive a tailored plan and schedule your sessions.</li>\\n        <li>Begin the program with clear experiments and check-ins.</li>\\n      </ol>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='faq panel' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px'>Program questions</h2>\\n      <details style='margin-bottom:8px'><summary style='font-weight:700'>How do I decide between Momentum Month and Foundations 12?</summary><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Momentum Month is for immediate momentum; Foundations 12 is for layered habit change over time. We recommend a clarity call to match fit.</p></details>\\n      <details style='margin-bottom:8px'><summary style='font-weight:700'>Can I add a VIP day to Foundations 12?</summary><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Yes — the VIP day is an add-on to accelerate breakthroughs within a longer program.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary style='font-weight:700'>Are there refunds?</summary><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Refund and rescheduling policies are shared at sign-up; email <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a> for specifics.</p></details>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px' class='panel'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 10px'>Grab the framework</h2>\\n      <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Download a short worksheet: The 3-part habit architecture I use with every new client.</p>\\n      <form style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px' action='#' method='post'>\\n        <input type='email' placeholder='Email address' required>\\n        <button class='btn' type='submit' style='background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px'>Send me the worksheet</button>\\n      </form>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px;text-align:center'>\\n      <h3 style='margin-bottom:10px'>Questions about a path?</h3>\\n      <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700'>Book a clarity call</a>\\n      <p class='note' style='margin-top:8px'>Prefer email? <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <small>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a></small>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
